  "text": "The computer that sent your link runs an older svrngs, so this page cannot show what house lends. Installing svrngs again there updates it.\n\nOn this computer, paste this line in a terminal: it gets svrngs, joins you, and opens your home page, with the group’s folder on your disk. If svrngs is on this computer already, paste the link you opened on your home page instead, under “Join a group from a link”.\n\ncurl -fsSL http://127.0.0.1:51631/install.sh | sh -s -- 'http://127.0.0.1:51631/#AoqI4910CfGV_VLbLTy6XXLKZwm_HZQSG_N0iAG0D29cAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGh0dHA6Ly8xMjcuMC4wLjE6NTA5MzMv'\nCopy",
