  "status": "You’re in house, as Ana",
  "text": "You’re in house, as Ana\n\nOn this computer, paste this line in a terminal: it gets svrngs, joins you, and opens your home page, with the group’s folder on your disk. If svrngs is on this computer already, paste the link you opened on your home page instead, under “Join a group from a link”.\n\ncurl -fsSL http://127.0.0.1:53131/install.sh | sh -s -- 'http://127.0.0.1:53131/#AupKbGPinFIKvvVQexMuxfmVR3auvr57kkIe6mkURtIsAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGh0dHA6Ly8xMjcuMC4wLjE6NTIxMTEv'\nCopy\nKim on now\nbo on now\nAna on now\nWhat\tWhat it is\tWhose\tHow it opens\tNow\nBring things to the table\n\nThese come with svrngs. Bring one, and everyone in house opens it on their own computer or phone, while any computer in house is on.\n\n Money: who paid for what, and who owes whom.\n\n Events: post a get-together, and see who’s coming.\n\n House rules: the rules your house agrees, and how you agree them.\n\nBring the ticked ones to house\n\nNobody in house lends anything yet.",
  "visiting": []
}
